{"call_id": "b2f92566b2d24ab49e804e075fa67167", "success": true, "result_file": "/data/nly/Agent-Aware-Trajectory-Level-Query/benchmark/fullbench/runs/fad/PANCANCER_ATLAS/query1/full-01/results/b2f92566b2d24ab49e804e075fa67167.json", "row_count": null, "preview": "{\"submitted\": true, \"answer\": \"Average log10-transformed IGF2 expression for LGG (Brain Lower Grade Glioma) patients, by histological type\\n(Only patients with valid, positive IGF2 normalized_count values and histology annotations not enclosed in square brackets were included.)\\n\\nAstrocytoma: 2.5700 (n=10 patients)\\nOligoastrocytoma: 2.7126 (n=5 patients)\\nOligodendroglioma: 2.6814 (n=8 patients)\\n\\nMethod: LGG patients (513) were identified in clinical_info via Patient_description mentioning \\\"Lower Grade Glioma\\\"; full TCGA barcodes were extracted from Patient_description; histological_type values were filtered to exclude NULL and bracket-enclosed annotations (none existed for LGG). IGF2 normalized_count values (non-null, >0) were taken from RNASeq_Expression in the molecular database and inner-joined on patient barcode (23 patients matched). log10 was applied per patient, then averaged within each histology group.\\n\"}", "truncated": false}
